<title>HONG KONG: Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on NW Infra.</title>
<headline>Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on NW Infra.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd said has issued 200 million American-style call warrants on shares of New World Infrastructure Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$25.30	  PREMIUM	  27.8 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.4094	 GEARING	  5.62X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  27.FEB.98	 PAYDATE	  16.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	 LISTING DATE   18.DEC.96</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$23	     MIN EXER LOT   2,000</p>
<p>NOTES: CASH SETTLEMENT OF EXERCISE AMOUNT PAYABLE IN HONG KONG DOLLAR OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY OF STOCKS AT ISSUER'S DISCRETION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
